Q2. Design a Non-Deterministic Finite Automata to accept the strings with 0’s and 1’s such 
that string contains two consecutive 0’s (or) two consecutive 1’s. 
Solution:- 
Q = {q0,q1,q2,q3,q4} 
     Σ = {0,1} 
     q0 = q0 
     F = {q2, q4}

